title: Lumbermill_Upgrade
tags: structure interaction lumbermill upgrade
---
<<jump Lumbermill_UpgradeMenu>>
===

title: Lumbermill_UpgradeMenu
tags: structure lumbermill upgrade
---
<<if $lumbermill_Level == 0>>
    Old Pell: The old mill's gone to rot — wheel seized, blades rusted through. Rebuild her and the wood'll come in faster than the forest can grieve it.
    -> Restore the Mill — 900 Wood / 300 Food. (+12% Wood yield.)
        <<TryUpgradeBuilding "lumbermill" 1>>
        <<jump Lumbermill_UpgradeResult>>
    -> Not yet.
        Old Pell: Then she sits and rusts a while longer. Pity. The walls eat wood, you know.
<<elseif $lumbermill_Level == 1>>
    Old Pell: Saws are singing again, hear that? Fit them with proper iron teeth and they'll bite twice as deep.
    -> Reinforced Blades — 1600 Wood / 600 Food / 150 Crystal. (+20% Wood yield.)
        <<TryUpgradeBuilding "lumbermill" 2>>
        <<jump Lumbermill_UpgradeResult>>
    -> Back.
        <<jump Lumbermill_UpgradeMenu>>
<<elseif $lumbermill_Level == 2>>
    Old Pell: The whole mill thunders now, dawn to dark. Rig her to run herself and she'll keep cutting clean while we sleep.
    -> Automated Saws — 3200 Wood / 1200 Food / 400 Crystal. (+35% Wood yield, +15% offline gathering.)
        <<TryUpgradeBuilding "lumbermill" 3>>
        <<jump Lumbermill_UpgradeResult>>
    -> Back.
        <<jump Lumbermill_UpgradeMenu>>
<<elseif $lumbermill_Level == 3>>
    Old Pell: <i>He rests a hand on the humming timbers.</i> She's near alive, this one — roots herself to the Heartwood and the grove gives freely. One last blessing and she'll be eternal.
    -> Eternal Grove — 6000 Wood / 2500 Food / 1000 Crystal. (+50% Wood yield + periodic wood burst.)
        <<TryUpgradeBuilding "lumbermill" 4>>
        <<jump Lumbermill_UpgradeResult>>
    -> Back.
        <<jump Lumbermill_UpgradeMenu>>
<<else>>
    Old Pell: The Eternal Grove stands — green where you walk, endless timber, the forest and the mill at peace at last. The Heart itself feeds her now. Nothing more these old hands can add.
    -> Beautiful work, Pell.
        Old Pell: It's the forest's work. I just keep the saws honest. Go build something worth the wood.
<<endif>>
===

title: Lumbermill_UpgradeResult
tags: structure lumbermill upgrade
---
Old Pell: <i>The wheel turns sweeter, the saws bite deeper.</i> There she goes. Good as her word.
-> Back.
    <<jump Lumbermill_UpgradeMenu>>
===
